WEBVTT

00:04:27.597 --> 00:04:31.463
I've seen how different we are,
how diverse and distinct.

00:04:32.463 --> 00:04:34.930
But I've also seen our commonalities.

00:04:34.963 --> 00:04:37.563
How much worship means in Tibet,

00:04:37.597 --> 00:04:39.030
in Pakistan,

00:04:39.030 --> 00:04:40.330
in Italy,

00:04:40.363 --> 00:04:41.797
in China,

00:04:41.830 --> 00:04:43.363
in Cambodia

00:04:43.397 --> 00:04:44.530
and in Peru.

00:04:45.630 --> 00:04:48.130
How much peace means to our future.

00:04:48.463 --> 00:04:51.363
How much we regret
the mistakes of our past.

00:04:52.530 --> 00:04:57.163
And now, insisting on what
matters no matter what.

00:04:58.797 --> 00:05:01.330
There is still so much
beauty in the world.